<h3>kuroko 0.5.0</h3>
<ul>
  <li><b>Web links become images:</b> <code>.webloc</code> / <code>.url</code> files landing in a watched folder (what Safari drops when you drag a picture out of Threads, Instagram, Dribbble…) are resolved — the image behind the link is downloaded, the link is trashed, and the image is converted if it's WebP/AVIF/HEIC</li>
  <li>Drop link files or a browser URL onto the menu bar icon to download + convert</li>
  <li>New <b>Web Links</b> toggle in Settings; <code>kuroko fetch</code> headless command</li>
</ul>
      ]]></description>
